From: Kees Cook <kees@kernel.org>
Subject: lib: move KUnit tests into tests/ subdirectory
Date: Fri, 11 Oct 2024 15:25:07 +0800

Following from the recent KUnit file naming discussion[1], move all KUnit
tests in lib/ into lib/tests/.

[davidgow@google.com: rebased on top of mm-nonmm-unstable]
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20240720165441.it.320-kees@kernel.org/ [1]
